OTOGAKURE — THE SOUND FIVE
Elite Unit Roster | Clearance: Restricted

The Sound Five are Lord Orochimaru's finest and most loyal operatives, drawn from the
survivors of the cursed seal and each bearing a signature art. Originally the Sound Four;
counted as Five when Kimimaro is in the ranks.

Roster
- Kimimaro — Leader. Kaguya bloodline, Dead Bone Pulse (Shikotsumyaku). The strongest of
  the Five and the once-designated preferred vessel. Currently withdrawn by illness.
- Tayuya — The only kunoichi of the group. Commands the three Doki through her flute; a
  genjutsu and control specialist.
- Sakon and Ukon — Brothers sharing one body. Parasitic fusion allows Ukon to destroy an
  enemy from within. Counted as one member.
- Jirobo — Earth-style specialist of great physical strength; drains an opponent's chakra
  by contact.
- Kidomaru — Six-limbed spider techniques; adhesive web and hardened chakra arrows. The
  unit's ranged specialist and trap-maker.

Standing Orders
The Five answer directly to Lord Orochimaru. They deploy as his personal guard and on
missions of the highest priority. Each is authorized Level 2 seal use in the field. Their
loyalty is absolute and expected to remain so unto death.
